@startuml MedicalImagingDiagnosisSequenceDiagram

skinparam DefaultFontSize 40
skinparam ActorFontSize 40


actor 医生 as Doctor
participant "Vue前端" as Frontend
participant "SpringBoot后端" as SpringBoot
participant "Python AI服务" as PythonAI
database "LocalStorage" as Storage

== 1. 影像上传与验证 ==

Doctor -> Frontend: 选择医学影像文件
Frontend -> Frontend: handleFileUpload()
Frontend -> Frontend: 文件类型和大小验证
Frontend -> Frontend: 生成Data URL预览
Frontend -> Storage: 保存imagePreview到localStorage

Doctor -> Frontend: 点击"开始诊断"
Frontend -> Frontend: 设置loading状态
Frontend -> Storage: 保存loading状态到localStorage

Frontend -> SpringBoot: POST /api/ai/image-diagnosis
note right: FormData: image文件 + doctorInfo JSON

== 2. 后端处理与AI服务调用 ==

SpringBoot -> SpringBoot: 接收MultipartFile
SpringBoot -> SpringBoot: 文件验证(空文件、类型、10MB大小)
SpringBoot -> SpringBoot: 解析doctorInfo JSON
SpringBoot -> SpringBoot: 生成requestId\n记录pendingRequests

SpringBoot -> PythonAI: POST /image-diagnosis
note right: {requestId, imageData(base64),\nimageName, doctorInfo, callbackUrl}

PythonAI --> SpringBoot: 立即返回{"success": true, "message": "处理中"}
SpringBoot --> Frontend: 立即返回CompletableFuture

== 3. AI影像分析与异步回调 ==

PythonAI -> PythonAI: base64解码为二进制数据
PythonAI -> PythonAI: MedicalImageDiagnosis.diagnose_from_bytes()
note right: AI模型进行深度影像分析\n(设置600秒超时)

PythonAI -> PythonAI: 构建诊断结果数据
PythonAI -> SpringBoot: POST /image-diagnosis-callback
note right: {requestId, content, type: "IMAGE_DIAGNOSIS"}

SpringBoot -> SpringBoot: 从pendingRequests获取CompletableFuture
SpringBoot -> SpringBoot: 构建AISessionResponse\n设置诊断结果数据
SpringBoot -> SpringBoot: future.complete(response)\n移除pending记录

SpringBoot --> Frontend: **异步回调完成**

== 4. 前端结果展示与状态保存 ==

Frontend -> Frontend: 接收诊断结果
Frontend -> Frontend: 格式化诊断结果文本
note right: 换行、加粗、斜体处理

Frontend -> Frontend: 显示诊断报告
Frontend -> Frontend: 显示诊断时间和处理时长
Frontend -> Frontend: 清除loading状态

Frontend -> Storage: 保存diagnosisResult\ndiagnosisTime, processingTime

Doctor -> Frontend: 查看诊断报告

@enduml